# Keep Plex Web local: don't probe for a Plex Media Server on the loopback
# address (127.0.0.1:32400).
#
# plex.tv itself is left to the Content-Security-Policy (webui.go): its
# health check is blocked in the browser, so Plex Web records plex.tv as
# unreachable and skips its cloud features. Don't stub the cloud connection
# tests out instead: skipping them leaves plex.tv "pending" forever, and a
# new browser then hangs before Plex Web's first-run setup.
file: js/main-*.js
--- find
function(){if(!ae.A.allowLoopbackDiscovery)return;
--- replace
function(){return;
